            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A haploid oocyte that has advanced through meiosis to the stage at which it can be fertilized successfully by sperm. Mature echinoderm eggs have completed meiosis.</obo:IAO_0000115>
