            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The portion of the border ectoderm that is located between the oral and aboral border ectoderm. This region overlaps with part of the presumptive ciliary band.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>lateral BE</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
