        <obo:IAO_0000115>In species with a posterior enterocoel, it is the coelomic pouch that develops at the tip of the archenteron on the right side of the embryo.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>right anterior coelom</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:id>ECAO:2000538</oboInOwl:id>
